## Real-world pattern
GitLab CI example
YAML

stages:
  - build
  - deploy

build:
  stage: build
  script:
    - docker build -t app .
    - docker push app

deploy:
  stage: deploy
  script:
    - kubectl apply -f k8s/

Jenkins (Groovy Pipeline)
pipeline {
  agent any
  stages {
    stage('Build') {
      steps {
        sh 'docker build -t app .'
      }
    }
    stage('Deploy') {
      steps {
        sh 'kubectl apply -f k8s/'
      }
    }
  }
}





